      "proved_statement": "Walsh-Hadamard inversion recovers all four Liouville parity classes. The proposed one-sided gap equals four times the twin count, so its strict positivity is exactly blockwise twin existence. An absolute Walsh L1 contraction is a stronger, non-circular sufficient target.",
